---
import ServicePage from "../layouts/ServicePage.astro";
import { business } from "../data/business.js";
import { quotePrices as P } from "../data/quote-prices.js";
---
<ServicePage
  slug="boiler-repair-servicing"
  icon="emergency-boiler-repair"
  title="Emergency boiler repair"
  description={`Boiler broken down or no heating or hot water? We cover breakdowns ${business.breakdowns} across ${business.region}. Gas Safe registered engineer. Call ${business.phone}.`}
  intro={`No heating or hot water? We cover boiler breakdowns ${business.breakdowns} across ${business.region}. Call us and we'll get to you as quickly as we can.`}
>
  <div class="note" style="margin-bottom:28px">
    <p style="margin:0"><strong>Smell gas or think there's a leak?</strong> Don't call us first. Open the windows, turn off the gas at the meter, don't use switches or flames, and call the National Gas Emergency Service on <strong>0800 111 999</strong>. It's free and open 24 hours. Once the gas is safe, we can help with the repair.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>When to call us</h2>
  <ul class="tick-list">
    <li>Your boiler has stopped working and you've no heating or hot water</li>
    <li>The boiler is showing an error code or keeps shutting itself off</li>
    <li>The boiler is leaking water or making loud banging or whistling noises</li>
    <li>The pressure keeps dropping, or radiators are staying cold</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Before you call, our <a href="/blog/no-heating-or-hot-water-checks/">no heating or hot water checks</a> and our <a href="/blog/boiler-losing-pressure/">boiler losing pressure guide</a> take a few minutes, and sometimes fix the problem yourself.</p>

  <h2>What happens when you call</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><h3>You call us</h3><p>Tell us what the boiler is doing and roughly where you are. If you can, send a photo of the boiler and any error code on WhatsApp.</p></li>
    <li><h3>We come out</h3><p>We'll tell you when we can get there. Breakdowns are covered {business.breakdowns}.</p></li>
    <li><h3>We find and explain the fault</h3><p>The call-out is from £{P.repairCallout} plus parts. We explain what's wrong and price any repair before we start.</p></li>
    <li><h3>We fix it, or tell you honestly if it's not worth fixing</h3><p>If the boiler is past repairing, we'll explain your options, and you get a written quote for a new one with no pressure.</p></li>
  </ol>

  <p>We're Gas Safe registered, so you can be confident the work is done properly and legally. Normal hours are {business.hours}.</p>
  <div class="cta-actions" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:20px">
    <a class="btn btn-call" href={business.phoneHref}>Call {business.phone}</a>
    <a class="btn btn-quote" href={`https://wa.me/${business.whatsapp}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp us</a>
  </div>
</ServicePage>
